   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:medium;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13)\">Dear Cardinal developers and users,</span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:medium;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13)\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:medium;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13)\">I am excited to release ShinyCardinal, a GUI version of Cardinal</span>. </p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:medium;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13)\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:medium;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13)\">ShinyCardinal is built as a standalone desktop app with a user-friendly interface. Download at: <span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13)\"><a href=\"https://shinycardinal.sourceforge.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://shinycardinal.sourceforge.io/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793240500816000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1HLGoujJKvYxfNiaMWU8KM\">https://shinycardinal.sourceforge.io</a></span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:medium;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13)\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:medium;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13)\">It covers every step in MSI data analysis, powered by the versatile R package Cardinal, with new features like background noise removal, matrix peak removal, deisotoping, absolute quantification, data cropping, network analysis, and metabolite identification and export to METASPACE and other MSI software.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:medium;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13)\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:medium;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13)\">ShinyCardinal is a standalone desktop tool. Users do not have to separately install R or any R packages. No programming skills are required to run ShinyCardinal. Please check out our tutorial videos:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13)\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@MSI_WIS/videos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.youtube.com/@MSI_WIS/videos&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793240500816000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1e7oI4ls3O3Z_wySEDJ753\">https://www.youtube.com/@MSI_WIS/videos</a> </span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:medium;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13)\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:medium;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13)\">ShinyCardinal is written in a modular manner, which allows developers to easily modify the source code to continuously improve the software’s capabilities and incorporate more features. Your feedback and contributions are warmly welcomed!</span><span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13)\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:medium;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13)\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:medium;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13)\">ShinyCardinal wouldn&#39;t be possible without the solid foundation laid by Cardinal. My heartfelt gratitude to the developers of Cardinal, especially to Kylie, for paving the way.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13)\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:medium;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13)\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:medium;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13)\">Best regards,</span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:medium;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13)\">Yonghui Dong</span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:medium;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13)\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:medium;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13)\"><img alt=\"ShinyCardinal.png\" width=\"378px\" height=\"535px\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/CardinalMSI/attach/198a2c9db851c/ShinyCardinal.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:medium;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13)\"> </span></p>"
    ]
   ]
